  "ruleText": "Alc 307.01 Scope. The rules in Alc 306, Alc 307, and Alc 308 shall not apply to applicants applying for reciprocity-based LADC licensure under Alc 309 unless otherwise specified in Alc 309.\n\nSource. #9421, INTERIM, eff 3-14-09, EXPIRED: 9-10-09\n\nNew. #12001, eff 10-13-16; ss by #13518, eff 3-13-23 (formerly Alc 306.01)",
